    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "WHISPERS FROM THE LIMINAL · ep. 8 · sticker shock",
      "sub": "Honolulu · 1991, give or take",
      "duration": 2400
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "elicia",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "center"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Elicia",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Three timestamps, none of them in order. A father who was presumed dead for a few weeks, back in the early seventies.",
      "role": "— voice-over —"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Elicia",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Keep your receipts.",
      "role": "— voice-over —"
    },
    {
      "t": "hide",
      "pos": "center"
    },
    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "2003, as you be.",
      "sub": "",
      "duration": 1800
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Your dad."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Yes?"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "He was presumed dead for a few weeks there. Back in the early seventies."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "1991, a week ago.",
      "sub": "",
      "duration": 1800
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "‘They aren’t sure what you are.’"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "‘Scuse me,’ through spat out vodka upon polished reflective surfaces."
    },
    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "1991, a few days ago.",
      "sub": "",
      "duration": 1800
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "The first office is a hollowed out chunk of Honolulu high-rise. Ground floors are tourist trap photography parlour, travel agency, corner suit shoppe & luggage boutique. Next up, rental property management services, a sushi bar and occasional disco."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Above that, a floor shared between an old acquaintance and his new tenants. Homegrown software divided by import dynasty hardware."
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "They bring me up the back stairs that go up a f—"
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "elicia",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "center"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Elicia",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "It breaks off on the back stairs. Most stairs go somewhere. These ones we’ll have to imagine.",
      "role": "— voice-over —"
    },
    {
      "t": "hide",
      "pos": "center"
    },
